@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 1: POST /api/v1/refunds (Intake de la nota desde Ventas)

actor "Vendedor" as Seller
participant "App Ventas (MS_Sales)" as Sales
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Order Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_reasons DB" as ReasonsDB
participant "refund_approval_levels DB" as LevelsCfgDB
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_order_details DB" as DetailsDB
participant "refund_order_detail_sources DB" as SourcesDB
participant "refund_order_detail_photos DB" as PhotosDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_instance_levels DB" as LevelsDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

Seller -> Sales: Registra la nota de devolución (cliente, líneas, motivos, fotos)
Sales -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds\n(CreateRefundOrderDto)
note right of Sales
  Ventas es el dueño del alta.
  Logística no tiene formulario de creación:
  este endpoint ES el contrato con Ventas.
end note
Gateway -> Service: createRefundOrder(payload)

Service -> ReasonsDB: 1. findActiveReasons(payload.items.reason)
' note right of ReasonsDB
'   El catálogo dice qué evidencia exige cada
'   motivo: lot_requirement y
'   due_date_requirement en REQUIRED / OPTIONAL
'   / HIDDEN, más requires_photo y
'   requires_notes.
'   reason es FK: un motivo inventado no entra.
' end note
ReasonsDB --> Service: reasons[]

Service -> Service: 2. validatePayload(payload, reasons)
' note right of Service
'   - al menos una línea y quantity > 0
'   - price_unit congelado al momento del reclamo
'   - reason existe y está activo
'   - lote y vencimiento según el motivo:
'     REQUIRED exige el dato, HIDDEN lo descarta
'   - al menos una foto si requires_photo
'   - la suma de sources[].quantity es
'     EXACTAMENTE items[].quantity
' end note

Service -> Service: 3. computeTotal(payload.items)
note right of Service
  total = SUM(quantity * price_unit)
  de las líneas ACTIVE
end note

Service -> LevelsCfgDB: 4. findActiveApprovalLadder(total)
' note right of LevelsCfgDB
'   SELECT de la versión publicada:
'   is_active = TRUE AND deleted_at IS NULL,
'   ORDER BY level_order.
'   El techo de cada nivel es el piso del
'   siguiente; el último no tiene techo.
'   El nivel 1 SIEMPRE entra. Los niveles cuyo
'   piso quedó por encima del total nacen
'   'SKIPPED': el monto nunca los alcanza.
' end note
LevelsCfgDB --> Service: ladder[] (level_order, name, role_code,\nmin_amount, max_amount, approval_policy,\nrequired_approvals, on_reject, sla_hours)

Service -> TX: 5. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> OrdersDB: 6. insertRefundOrder(payload, total)
' note right of OrdersDB
'   - external_sales_id = id de la nota en Ventas
'     (idempotencia: el UNIQUE con split_sequence
'     corta el reintento del POST)
'   - note_number = correlativo de Ventas
'   - split_sequence = 0
'   - document_type = 'ORIGINAL'
'   - status = 'OPEN'
'   - source_refund_order_id = NULL
'   - distributor_id, employee_id,
'     owner_id, customer_id
'   - replacement_date, justification
'   - edit_count = 0
'   - approved_total, rejected_total y
'     settlement_type quedan NULL hasta el cierre
' end note
OrdersDB --> Service: refundOrderId: 2001

Service -> DetailsDB: 7. insertRefundOrderDetails(2001, payload.items)
note right of DetailsDB
  Por línea:
  - source_quantity = quantity (se congela)
  - line_status = 'ACTIVE'
  - source_detail_id = NULL (nace acá)
  - reason, notes
end note
DetailsDB --> Service: detailIds[]: [3001, 3002]

Service -> SourcesDB: 8. insertDetailSources(detailIds, payload.items.sources)
note right of SourcesDB
  De qué factura y de qué lote sale cada
  unidad: invoice_number, invoice_sap_doc,
  invoiced_at, lot, due_date, quantity.
  invoice_sap_doc es referencia lógica: SAP
  no es nuestra base.
end note
SourcesDB --> Service: ok

Service -> PhotosDB: 9. insertDetailPhotos(detailIds, payload.items.photos)
note right of PhotosDB
  La evidencia que abre el revisor:
  storage_key (la fuente), url servida,
  content_type, sort_order y uploaded_by.
  El UNIQUE de storage_key evita subir dos
  veces el mismo objeto.
end note
PhotosDB --> Service: ok

Service -> InstanceDB: 10. insertWorkflowInstance(2001, attempt: 1, 'IN_APPROVAL', currentLevelOrder: 1)
InstanceDB --> Service: workflowInstanceId: 90

Service -> OrdersDB: 11. updateCurrentWorkflowInstance(2001, 90)
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> LevelsDB: 12. insertInstanceLevelsSnapshot(90, ladder)
' note right of LevelsDB
'   Congela la escalera de ESTE intento:
'   banda (min_amount / max_amount),
'   approval_policy, required_approvals,
'   on_reject y sla_hours.
'   - nivel 1: decision_mode = 'ITEM_SELECTION',
'     status = 'IN_PROGRESS', started_at = NOW()
'   - niveles 2..N: 'DOCUMENT_DECISION',
'     status = 'PENDING'
'   Republicar la configuración no
'   reescribe la historia.
' end note
LevelsDB --> Service: levelIds[]: [200, 201]

Service -> ActionsDB: 13. insertWorkflowAction(90, level: NULL, 'CREATED')
note right of ActionsDB
  - actor_employee_code = vendedor
  - new_status = 'IN_APPROVAL'
  - amount_after = total
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 14. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

note right of Service
  Reintento del mismo external_sales_id:
  el UNIQUE lo rechaza y el servicio responde
  200 con la nota ya creada, no un duplicado.
end note

Service --> Gateway: 201 Created (RefundOrderCreatedResult:\n{ refundOrderId, noteNumber, total, currentLevel })
Gateway --> Sales: 201 Created
Sales --> Seller: Nota registrada • En aprobación, Nivel 1 de N
@enduml
